The final Gaussian blend was worse (`3.1190922694449583e-07`), so I’ll remove it. One larger variance-reduction idea remains: full covariance matching after the first ReLU instead of only diagonal mean/variance matching. I’ll screen that locally first because it adds eigendecompositions.
